<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>VO2max L09B - Hard-Start 6x4 (140 then 110)</name>
    <description>VO2max - level 9 of 10, variant B. Hard-Start 6x4 (140 then 110).

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 30 s @ 140%, 3:30 @ 110%, 3 min @ 50%, 30 s @ 140%, 3:30 @ 110%, 3 min @ 50%, 30 s @ 140%, 3:30 @ 110%, 3 min @ 50%, 30 s @ 140%, 3:30 @ 110%, 3 min @ 50%, 30 s @ 140%, 3:30 @ 110%, 3 min @ 50%, 30 s @ 140%, 3:30 @ 110%, 5 min @ 60%, 6 min cool-down.

Coach notes: 30 s at 140% then 3:30 at 110%. The hard start drives oxygen uptake up fast; the 110% part feels much harder than usual.

Estimated TSS: 70.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="VO2max"/>
        <tag name="Level 9"/>
    </tags>
    <workout>
        <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.45" PowerHigh="0.75">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="VO2max session. Warm up thoroughly and add two 15 s accelerations in the last 3 minutes."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="480" message="2 minutes to the main set. Lift the effort slightly."/>
        </Warmup>
        <SteadyState Duration="30" Power="1.40">
